{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"一、三年，春正月，公會齊侯于嬴。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊侯、衞侯胥命于蒲。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"胥命者何？相命也。何言乎相命？近正也。此其為近正奈何？古者不盟，結言而退。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"三、六月，公會紀侯于盛。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月壬辰朔，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"既者何？盡也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"五、公子翬如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"六、九月，齊侯送姜氏于讙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？諸侯越竟送女，非禮也。此入國矣，何以不稱夫人？自我言齊，父母之於子，雖為鄰國夫人，猶曰吾姜氏。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯于讙，夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"翬何以不致？得見乎公矣","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"八、冬，齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"九、有年。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_14_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_14","textTraditional":"有年，何以書？以喜書也。大有年，何以書？亦以喜書也。此其曰有年何？僅有年也。彼其曰大有年何？大豐年也。僅有年亦足以當喜乎？恃有年也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}